{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wanted to escape from the stress of urban life? <strong>Nom Nom: Cozy Forest Caf\u00e9</strong> is a cozy and relaxing decoration and rhythm game where you manage a caf\u00e9 and befriend cute animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low stress, non confrontational, relaxing experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage your own cafeteria:</strong> Customize your place with furniture, decorations, lamps, wallpaper, and flooring. Take pictures of your favourite corners, dishes, and customers and share them on the caf\u00e9's website.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/53dba7b3762f4f55b93d5be3829770ba.poster.avif?t=1763983762\" width=616 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/53dba7b3762f4f55b93d5be3829770ba.webm?t=1763983762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/53dba7b3762f4f55b93d5be3829770ba.mp4?t=1763983762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adorable customers:</strong> Forge friendships and learn about their favourite recipes and decorations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/fd27d4b1b74b1aaaef30f5ccf45e5e78.poster.avif?t=1763983762\" width=616 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/fd27d4b1b74b1aaaef30f5ccf45e5e78.webm?t=1763983762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/fd27d4b1b74b1aaaef30f5ccf45e5e78.mp4?t=1763983762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn new recipes... To the beat!</strong> Prepare snacks and drinks, from waffles to sodas, to the rhythm of upbeat tunes and colourful animations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/79ead9ef817b311b9f079f25d926878d.poster.avif?t=1763983762\" width=616 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/79ead9ef817b311b9f079f25d926878d.webm?t=1763983762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/79ead9ef817b311b9f079f25d926878d.mp4?t=1763983762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your creativity! Practice your skills whenever you like. Experiment with new ingredient combinations and sell them in your own vending machine to earn rewards!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/573527d54f376ef044bc141f88724899.poster.avif?t=1763983762\" width=616 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/573527d54f376ef044bc141f88724899.webm?t=1763983762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/573527d54f376ef044bc141f88724899.mp4?t=1763983762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use your own custom designs!</strong> You can customise different objects, as well as your dishes! Paint signs, posters and even T-shirts for your customers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/689878224f1a0a307ccfc8af28d277b5.avif?t=1763983762\" width=614 height=300 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2428800?t=1763983762","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763983762","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/782877bfe27952be7a0dc0e319a8e12f7b35da1d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763983762","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/782877bfe27952be7a0dc0e319a8e12f7b35da1d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763983762","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2550920,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wanted to escape from the stress of urban life? <strong>Nom Nom: Cozy Forest Caf\u00e9</strong> is a cozy and relaxing decoration and rhythm game where you manage a caf\u00e9 and befriend cute animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low stress, non confrontational, relaxing experience.</p></li><li><p class=